<title>USA: Costilla Energy sets $100 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>Costilla Energy sets $100 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue was priced on Thursday, said lead manager Nationsbanc Capital Markets.</p>
<p>BORROWER COSTILLA ENERGY INC</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 10.25 PCT  MATURITY 10/1/2006</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 100.00  PAY DATE 04/1/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY B1	SPREAD    N.A.    PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-B  YIELD  10.25 PCT  CALLABLE AFTER FIVE YEARS UNDERLYING: 10-YEAR U.S. TREASURY NOTE</p>
<p>-- U.S. corporate bond unit 212-859-1678</p>
